            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/634180/extras/74804d77cf07494423ec626b5d10446a.avif?t=1777692672\" width=1560 height=728 /></span><br><strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far would you go to save your only daughter from the clutches of death?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the award-winning studio <strong>Tuttifrutti Interactive</strong> comes an untold saga of motherhood and true love. <strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest</strong> is a frantic, emotional journey set against the backdrop of the enchanted valleys and forgotten legends of the Indus civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Mary, her daughter Sophia is her entire world. Seeking to rediscover her long-lost family roots, Mary travels with her husband and daughter to a cluster of remote islands. Her life is shattered in an instant when a mysterious letter arrives, unearthing a dark past she never knew existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, broken and betrayed, Mary must enter the <strong>Netherworld</strong>—a realm where destiny is written in blood and danger lurks in every corner. Step into Mary’s shoes and navigate a perilous game of life and death to bring your daughter home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Darkarta?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Legacy of Excellence:</strong> A former <strong>#1 Classic Hit</strong> on PC and Mac markets (Big Fish Games) and winner of over <strong>10 International Awards</strong>, including honors from <i>Game Connection America</i> and <i>Casual Connect Asia</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Journey:</strong> Explore a magnificent fictional world inspired by Indus fantasy, ancient mythologies, and the philosophy of reincarnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Powerful Message:</strong> Beyond the mystery, this is a story about &quot;star-crossed lovers&quot; and a stand against racism, upholding the enduring power of humanity and motherhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Artistry:</strong> Immerse yourself in critically acclaimed, breathtaking visuals and highly detailed environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/634180/extras/49676ea1647475747f7e118486525bc0.avif?t=1777692672\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Standard Edition Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-6 Hours of Gameplay:</strong> Experience a gripping main story with non-repetitive puzzles and unforeseen environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prequel Comic Book:</strong> Dive deeper into the lore with a beautifully illustrated backstory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mom’s Diary:</strong> Follow Mary’s journey through her personal notes, character sketches, and an integrated strategy map. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/634180/extras/de8ea4108d6a8b072c28fa0e59d04305.avif?t=1777692672\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3,700 years have passed, but time cannot heal a broken heart. Will you answer the call?</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/634180/extras/74804d77cf07494423ec626b5d10446a.avif?t=1777692672\" width=1560 height=728 /></span><br><strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far would you go to save your only daughter from the clutches of death?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the award-winning studio <strong>Tuttifrutti Interactive</strong> comes an untold saga of motherhood and true love. <strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest</strong> is a frantic, emotional journey set against the backdrop of the enchanted valleys and forgotten legends of the Indus civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Mary, her daughter Sophia is her entire world. Seeking to rediscover her long-lost family roots, Mary travels with her husband and daughter to a cluster of remote islands. Her life is shattered in an instant when a mysterious letter arrives, unearthing a dark past she never knew existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, broken and betrayed, Mary must enter the <strong>Netherworld</strong>—a realm where destiny is written in blood and danger lurks in every corner. Step into Mary’s shoes and navigate a perilous game of life and death to bring your daughter home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Darkarta?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Legacy of Excellence:</strong> A former <strong>#1 Classic Hit</strong> on PC and Mac markets (Big Fish Games) and winner of over <strong>10 International Awards</strong>, including honors from <i>Game Connection America</i> and <i>Casual Connect Asia</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Journey:</strong> Explore a magnificent fictional world inspired by Indus fantasy, ancient mythologies, and the philosophy of reincarnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Powerful Message:</strong> Beyond the mystery, this is a story about &quot;star-crossed lovers&quot; and a stand against racism, upholding the enduring power of humanity and motherhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Artistry:</strong> Immerse yourself in critically acclaimed, breathtaking visuals and highly detailed environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/634180/extras/49676ea1647475747f7e118486525bc0.avif?t=1777692672\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Standard Edition Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-6 Hours of Gameplay:</strong> Experience a gripping main story with non-repetitive puzzles and unforeseen environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prequel Comic Book:</strong> Dive deeper into the lore with a beautifully illustrated backstory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mom’s Diary:</strong> Follow Mary’s journey through her personal notes, character sketches, and an integrated strategy map. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/634180/extras/de8ea4108d6a8b072c28fa0e59d04305.avif?t=1777692672\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3,700 years have passed, but time cannot heal a broken heart. Will you answer the call?</p>",
            "short_description": "Haunted by mysterious curses from her orphanage days, Mary is finally forced to confront the truth behind her past. Step into the enchanted Netherworld—a realm where destiny is written in blood and every choice shapes her fate. An award-winning adventure blending mystery, emotion, and dark fantasy.",
